[
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500370"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "哎呀，小兄弟，你可是買了好東西呢――！ 謝謝惠顧――！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_000",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500030"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "{0}在道具店購物，\\n當他得意洋洋地走出店門時，被精靈族的女性搭話了。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "可以耽誤你一下嗎？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_001",
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "剛剛我從那個露天陽台，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_002",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n看見你在買東西……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "你是不是花了5000盧幣左右買了那一瓶創傷藥？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_003",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "好東西……？\\n",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_004",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "可以讓我看一下嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……果然。\\n這個是接近最低等的商品喔。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_005",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "一般來說，3瓶頂多只值200盧幣吧。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "老實說……你被敲竹槓了喔。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_006",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "很吃驚吧。\\n你從道具店出來時似乎非常高興呢。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_007",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "你……真溫柔呢。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_008",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "但是去拜託也太懦弱了吧，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n我覺得你最後又會被哄騙。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……嗯――。\\n雖然我不太擅長處理這種事……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_009",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "但我還是努力看看吧。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "嗯？ 你問我在想什麼？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_010",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這個嘛……你跟我來的話就知道了喔。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "呵呵，放心。交給姐姐吧。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_011",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500370"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "妳好，歡迎光臨！\\n漂亮的小姐，今天要找什麼呢？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_012",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "是呢……有創傷藥嗎？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_013",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "喔！ 小姐妳運氣真好！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_014",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n今天有珍藏的好東西到貨了喔！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這樣啊，好東西。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_015",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "你說的是……賣給這孩子的低等貨嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "什……那個小傢伙是剛剛的……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_016",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "很明顯的，\\n你以不合理的價格將創傷藥強迫推銷給這孩子。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_017",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "欺騙尚未成年的冒險者，\\n將便宜貨以高價強迫推銷……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_018",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n請你別在這個城鎮裡做這種貪得無厭的生意好嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "……嘖。女孩子別太自以為是。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_019",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "你說什麼？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_020",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "我哪裡錯了啊？\\n在這個充斥著魔物、弱肉強食的世界啊，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_021",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n我只是從弱小的傢伙身上榨取金錢而已啊！！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這孩子是因為相信你才付錢。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_022",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n你這",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "樣做不會良心不安嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "才不會呢！\\n",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_023",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "是他自己像笨蛋一樣乖乖聽信我的話！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "怎麼想都是錯在被騙的他吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……這樣啊，我明白了",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_024",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "啊？ 妳又明白什麼了――",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_025",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "――蘭德索爾商法第19條：於城邑經商者，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_026",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n不得以不正當的買賣從冒險者身上獲取利益。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "……什麼！？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_027",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "或是蘭德索爾商法第24條：所有買賣商品的商家，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_028",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n其商品價格必須統一，不得因種族、職業等而有差別。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "你的行為或許也會涉及這部分的法條？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "那、",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_029",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "那是……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "有必要的話，要打官司也沒問題喔。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_030",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n因為我熟記蘭德索爾經濟相關的法律。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "要好好戰到最後一刻嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "對――",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_031",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "對不起！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n請不要公開這件事……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n我為我剛才的失言道歉！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "賣給這孩子藥的錢呢？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_032",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "當、當然會全額退還！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_033",
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "道具屋店長",
    "words": "\\n所以，請、請放過我吧……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "――你能理解真是再好不過了。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_034",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "以後請親切地對待冒險者，正派地做生意喔。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_035",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500030"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "給你，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_036",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這是退回來的錢。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "真是的，你不覺得他應該多給一點嗎？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "啊啊，不用給我謝禮了啦。我是優花梨。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_037",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "我在墨丘利財團公會擔任類似會計的職位，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "\\n所以擅長與錢有關的事情。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "沒……怎麼見過你，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_038",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "\\n你是最近才來這裡的？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "這樣啊，你叫這個名字啊……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_039",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "呵呵，真是個天真又可愛的孩子呢。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "\\n不對壞大人小心一點可是不行的喔♪",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "優花梨",
    "words": "那麼，我們可能還會再見也說不定呢。下次見喔！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1034001_040",
    "unit_id": 103411
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "{0}邂逅了突然瀟灑出現，\\n並替自己解圍的出色姐姐，\\n而為此感動。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  }
]
